  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Our drones",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Drones</strong>, then <strong>Our drones</strong> and <strong>+ Add drone</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/068dde313891abff.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Make a type",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>New type</strong> for a drone your team has not typed yet.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b39402ba24ab2d05.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name and class it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Type a short <strong>Name</strong>, then pick its <strong>Frame</strong>, <strong>Payload</strong> and <strong>Link</strong>. <strong>Attack</strong>, <strong>Bomber</strong> and <strong>Multi-role</strong> drones can strike.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/900e107007ea555f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Fill in the numbers",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Fill in the numbers as your team flies it, then tap <strong>Save</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1a765929ea2bd859.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Count your drones",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Saving adds one drone. <strong>+</strong> and <strong>−</strong> keep the count true, and a drone used or lost comes off by itself.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9539d72cfab669b9.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set team status",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Set <strong>Team status</strong> as you move or rest. The HQ and the TOC see it with your drones.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/349998f8f11f9417.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name your video stream",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On <strong>Settings</strong>, under <strong>Video</strong>, <strong>Send our video to</strong> names your stream. Left empty, it uses live/uas/ and your callsign.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/280c54db547dc23d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Turn on weather",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Set <strong>Weather lookups</strong> to <strong>On</strong>. Your plans then check FMI's forecast.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/dc93a04c5041895c.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
